$NetBSD$

Use the shared X11, Brotli and IJS providers. Select the build compiler,
CUPS metadata and pkg-config for their respective cross-build roles.
The configure fallback compares the complete FreeType version.
Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted); upstream status: not submitted.

